          "docs": "Returns a list of RBAC scopes available for an organization to use when creating custom roles.\nThese will match directly with the Super Admin role scopes.\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List users",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://app.shiftleft.io/api/v4/orgs/:orgID/rbac/users",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "orgID",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "The org ID"
              },
              {
                "name": "email",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Exact email lookup. When present, returns users matching the given address(es) instead of listing the organization. Mutually exclusive with `search`.\n"
              },
              {
                "name": "search",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Case-insensitive substring search on the user's display name or email address. Mutually exclusive with `email`.\n"
              },
              {
                "name": "team",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Restrict results to members of the team with this ID. Composes with `search`, `sort`, and `order`. When no user matches, the response is an empty list rather than a 404.\n"
              },
              {
                "name": "sort",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Field to sort results by. Defaults to `email` when omitted.\n"
              },
              {
                "name": "order",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Sort direction. Defaults to ascending when omitted.\n"
              },
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "The page of results to fetch. Results are not guaranteed to be deterministic using this approach; we recommended using the `next_page` URL in a paginated response\n"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns users in the organization with team membership and roles.\n\nWithout `email`, lists organization users. Responses with more than\n1000 users are paginated at 100 per page; the `next_page` field in the\nresponse carries the URL of the next page. Pagination can also be\nrequested explicitly via `page`. `search` filters the list to users\nwhose name or email contains the given substring (case-insensitive).\nWhen `search` matches no users, the response is an empty list rather\nthan a 404. `search` i"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List invitations",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://app.shiftleft.io/api/v4/orgs/:orgID/rbac/invitations",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "orgID",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "The org ID"
              },
              {
                "name": "search",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Case-insensitive substring search on the invitee's name or email address.\n"
              },
              {
                "name": "sort",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Field to sort results by. Defaults to `email` when omitted. `invited` sorts by the time the invitation was created.\n"
              },
              {
                "name": "order",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Sort direction. Defaults to ascending when omitted.\n"
              },
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "The page of results to fetch. Results are not guaranteed to be deterministic using this approach; we recommended using the `next_page` URL in a paginated response\n"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns the pending (unaccepted) invitations in the organization, with\nthe org-level role each invitee will receive on acceptance.\n\nResponses with more than 1000 invitations are paginated at 100 per page;\nthe `next_page` field in the response carries the URL of the next page.\nPagination can also be requested explicitly via `page`. `search` filters\nthe list to invitations whose name or email contains the given substring\n(case-insensitive). When `search` matches nothing — or the organization\nhas n"
        },
